          "Schema Markup (LocalBusiness)",
          "llms.txt for AI Agents",
          "Sitemap & Robots",
          "Uptime Monitoring",
          "Daily Backups",
          "Privacy-Friendly Analytics"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "groupTitles": [
      "Design & Layout",
      "Hosting & Infrastructure",
      "Trades-Specific Features",
      "SEO & Operations"
    ],
    "groupBodies": [
      "Mobile-first designs shaped specifically for trade businesses — practical typography, clear service pages, before/after photo grids, and contact-first layouts that put the estimate request one tap away.",
      "Modern static hosting with SSL, edge caching, and zero plugin maintenance. The site just keeps serving — even when you're three states deep in a remodel and not thinking about the website.",
      "The sections a homeowner or property manager actually looks for — service-area maps, crew bios, before/after photos, licensed-and-insured trust signals, and an estimate-request form that emails the right person on the right truck.",
      "Local SEO tuned for your service area, Google Business profile setup, schema markup, llms.txt for AI agents, and uptime monitoring — so prospective clients find you on search and AI engines, and the site stays online when they tap to call."
    ]
  },
  "nextSteps": {
    "sectionLabel": "What happens next",
    "steps": [
      {
        "num": "01",
        "title": "We read through what you shared",
        "body": "We take time with every inquiry — no auto-replies, no sales pipeline. Just a real read."
      },
      {
        "num": "02",
        "title": "We reply with honest thoughts",
        "body": "A ballpark timeline, a realistic budget range, and a candid take on whether we're a fit."
      },
      {
        "num": "03",
        "title": "If we're aligned, we schedule a call",
        "body": "A short conversation to dig into goals, questions, and next steps — no pressure."
      }
    ],
